'''Delinquent Cat''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.2 Update|Version 7.2]] increases health and range, reduces recharge time and gains [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target and [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]].

